Error [E0068]: This callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/contract_condition_impure.jet:7:53
    |
  7 | }, "cents must be positive") fn add_fee(cents: Int) => Int {
    |                                                     ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0068

Error [E0139]: a `#Pre` condition can't do I/O
  --> tests/ui/contract_condition_impure.jet:3:9
    |
  3 |         print("checking")
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: a contract is checked at every call and must be a pure claim about values
 Fix: move the effect out; keep only a pure test
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0139
